        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Camping World Stadium, Orlando City Stadium, Orlando, Florida, West Lakes, Downtown Orlando\n- Organizations: Orlando City SC, Orlando Pride, Major League Soccer, National Women's Soccer League\n- Facilities: Amway Center, Dr. Phillips Center for the Performing Arts\n\nFacts:\n- Camping World Stadium, also known as the Orlando Citrus Bowl, is a stadium in Orlando, Florida.\n- Camping World Stadium is in the West Lakes neighborhoods of Downtown Orlando.\n- Camping World Stadium is west of the Amway Center, the Dr. Phillips Center for the Performing Arts, and Orlando City Stadium.\n- Orlando City SC entered Major League Soccer as an expansion franchise in 2015.\n- Orlando City Stadium is the home venue for Orlando City SC.\n- Orlando City Stadium is also the home venue for Orlando Pride, the National Women's Soccer League sister club of Orlando City SC.",
